<algorithms>
<!-- Arrows added from the original figure, 2026-11. -->
<algorithm id="fig001">
<meta>
<id>091.1</id>
<supertype>AbCd</supertype>
<last_update>2007-09-13</last_update>
</meta>
<title>Jaundice: Evaluation.</title>
<graphic href="eee0210-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Is hyperbilirubinemia present?</label>
<path target="cell-2">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-3">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Urine bilirubin present or increased serum direct bilirubin?</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-5">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Conjugated hyperbilirubinemia.</label>
<path target="cell-6"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Possible extrahepatic cholestasis (elevations in alkaline phosphatase and GGT or a moderate to high pretest probability)?</label>
<path target="cell-7">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-7">
<label>Liver ultrasound/CT: are dilated bile ducts seen, or is there a high pretest probability of extrahepatic obstruction?</label>
<path target="cell-9">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-10">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Consider extrahepatic cholestasis (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-10">
<label>Conjugated hyperbilirubinemia with possible hepatocellular damage (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
<path target="cell-11"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-11">
<label>Workup negative.</label>
<path target="cell-12"></path>
<path target="cell-13"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-12">
<label>If other causes are unlikely, consider Dubin-Johnson syndrome or Rotor syndrome.</label>
<path target="cell-13"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-13">
<label>Consider repeat evaluation and observation.</label>
<path target="cell-14"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-14">
<label>Consider gastroenterology&#x002F;hepatology consult&#x002F;liver biopsy.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-8">
<label>Concern for intrahepatic cholestasis or hepatocellular damage (elevations in AST&#x002F;ALT)?</label>
<path target="cell-10">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Unconjugated hyperbilirubinemia (urine negative for bilirubin; normal direct bilirubin; see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Pseudojaundice (normal laboratory evaluation; see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
</algorithms>
